              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UHiramu inkosi yaseTire wathuma izinceku zakhe kuSolomoni; ngoba wezwa ukuthi bamgcobile abe yinkosi endlini kayise, ngoba uHiramu wayethanda uDavida njalo.",
          "type": "text",
