          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngaphandle kwezinduna zabaphathi bakaSolomoni ababephethe umsebenzi, izinkulungwane ezintathu namakhulu amathathu, ezazibusa phezu kwabantu abenza umsebenzi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
